<title>USA: New Berlin, Wis., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>New Berlin, Wis., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc., said it won $4.730 million of New Berlin, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 4.47 percent.</p>
</text>
